    {
      "comment": "capture:comment",
      "match": "(?m)^\\s*#.*$",
      "name": "comment.line.opentide"
    },
    {
      "comment": "capture:string",
      "match": "\"(\\\\.|[^\"\\\\])*\"|'(\\\\.|[^'\\\\])*'",
      "name": "string.quoted.opentide"
    },
    {
      "comment": "capture:number",
      "match": "\\b[0-9]+(\\.[0-9]+)?\\b",
      "name": "constant.numeric.opentide"
    },
    {
      "comment": "capture:tide.property",
      "match": "(?m)^\\s*(?:action|actions|actors|advanced|alert|alert_severity|alerting|allow_block|allow_zero_values|analysis|anomaly_threshold|antimalware_scan|any|append_to_rule|arch|author|availability|bcc|bitdefender|building_block|carbon_black_cloud|cardinality|category|cc|chaining|classification|collect_investigation_package|column|companies|comparator|composition|comps|condition|confidence|configurations|containment|contains|content_type|context|contributors|cool_off|correlation|correlation_search|create_incident|created|criteria|criticality|cron|crowdstrike|custom_condition|custom_details|custom_time|cve|data|data_view_id|default|defender_for_endpoint|description|details|detection|detection_model|detectors|device|device_groups|devices|direction|disable_fallback|disable_user|drilldown|duration|dynamic_properties|earliest|effort|elastic|email|enabled|end|endpoint|endpoint_tags|ensure_enrichment_completeness|entities|entity|entries|eql|event|event_category_override|events|examples|exceptions|exclusions|expiration|expires|export|false_positives|field|fields|file|files|filters|flags|force_password_reset|frequency|google_secops|group_by|group_by_alert_details|group_by_custom_details|group_by_entities|group_name|grouping|grouping_lookback|groups|guide|harfanglab|highlighted_fields|history_window_start|id|identifier|impact|impacted_entities|imports|include|include_children|include_parent|index|indicator_path|initiate_investigation|inline_results|integration|internal|interval|investigation|investment|is|isolate|isolate_device|items|job_id|key|kill_process|killchain|language|late_arriving_data_adjustment|latest|let|leverage|link|list_id|lists|logsource|logsources|lookback|machine_learning|macros|mailbox|mapping|mappings|mark_as_compromised|match|match_in_order|matches_required|matching|maturity|max_alerts|message|meta|metadata|methodology|minimum_engine_version|missing_fields_strategy|mitre_attack|modified|modifiers|name|namespace_type|negate|network_quarantine|new_